license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  A framework manuscript on managing personal and professional context with
  AI agents: one self-contained folder per theme around one living note, in
  plain portable files, where the human captures, arranges, decides and
  deletes, and agents distill, recycle and prune. Appendix A and the Part V templates are dedicated to the public
  domain under CC0 1.0.
keywords:
  - context engineering
  - AI agents
  - AGENTS.md
  - personal knowledge management
  - second brain
  - local-first
